# PR Templates & Copy-Paste Parts for The Forge Mobile
Use these ready-to-copy PR bodies, titles, and related artifacts when creating PRs in the repository. Each section contains:
- Suggested PR title
- Problem statement / context
- Proposed change summary
- Files to change (suggested)
- Testing steps / QA
- Design brief for Gemini (visual assets you can paste into Gemini)
- Labels / reviewers / rollout notes

Replace bracketed placeholders (e.g., [PROJECT_NAME], [BRANCH], [ISSUE_ID]) with actual values.

